    "Summaries": {
        "eng": "Captain Taiyo and his guardian android, Kei, travel through space onboard the Agga Ruter, a special ship not unlike some certain Jurai-related vessels. During their travels, Kei teaches Taiyo very special lessons in how to please women.\r\n\r\nNow that Taiyo has finally become a man, Kei can start their new adventure to find the Virginia and other key components her master has sent her out to locate. But the space pirates are hot on their trail to claim the ship and the secret components for themselves.",
        "jpn": "Follow Taiyo and Kei on their journey in space, filled with laughter and skinship as they meet new friends and enemies in their search for the missing core of Agga Ruter."
